# First powered test (spec M2): a light score on card.
# A 30 mm square drawn as four separate lines (the planner must join them),
# a 10 mm circle inside it (must be cut first), at 10% power, 100 mm/s.
# Origin at the square's bottom-left corner: put the head there, Start From
# current position.
ljob 1 name="card-test" source="hand-written"
origin 0.000 0.000
layer 5 color=5 mode=vector speed=100 power=10,10 passes=1 air=on order=1
path 5 open
  0.000 0.000
  30.000 0.000
end
path 5 open
  30.000 30.000
  0.000 30.000
end
path 5 open
  30.000 0.000
  30.000 30.000
end
path 5 open
  0.000 30.000
  0.000 0.000
end
path 5 closed
